Z||000000||grinthock||04-13-2001||07:41 PM||||For everyone who was waiting, and for anyone who cares... my custom intake project is done....<BR> <A HREF="http://grinthock.2y.net/87intake.html" TARGET=_blank>http://grinthock.2y.net/87intake.html</A> <P>I still have to chrome the tube, anyone with comments post here!||||reg||3
