Z||000015||grinthock||04-15-2001||03:53 PM||||Ok let me respond to EVERYONE;<P>Honesty fyrestarter you come off with a bad attitude and this is my first experience with you, so far, you are a knob, not *******  yet, just a knob.<P>As for the fab?  Yeah I was the one who cut the Ubend and found the nut, I can't weld **** , I was also the one who put the pipe in, found the parts, like I said the only parts that are off the shelf are the filter and that silicone peice, other than that I built it myself, the pipe as seen IN my pics is and WAS build by me, Sorry next time just for you I will get you pics of ME cutting the damn thing (oh and I DID take some they didn't turn out, lighting was bad, all you saw was sparks...)<P>Galen;  in response to your comment, honestly I do'nt think mine is any better or worse than his EITHER we obviously both had the SAME idea, with the SAME parts and had the SAME issues (bar in the way!)<P>Hmm sounds like the invention of the TELEPHONE to me... 2 people IDENTICAL ideas, 2 different countries.....  <P>The guy who helped me works at an exhaust shop and they do intakes and exhaust stuff, he had never done a fiero before.. I don't take credit for all the work but it was my idea, he just helped put it all togeather.<P>||||reg||4
